  "findings": "Two basal leaves and single nodding yellow flower with reflexed tepals; generic raceme rejected. Dedicated erythronium staged. Leaf mottling remains an appearance limitation. Current seeds 1, 4 and 7 and every panel in the 36-seed contact sheet were visually inspected. Paired basal blades and single curved scapes replace generic racemes. At 15\u201325 cm the nodding reflexed tepals reduce to yellow tip cells; leaf mottling remains absent. Physical size is retained. Accepted as a coarse stylized spring source at 25 mm; user endorsement remains separate.",
